    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Once upon a time, in the pacific northwest...</i><br><br>Departure is an management sim set in the air traffic control tower of a small, regional airport. Players are tasked with directing incoming and outgoing flights during the normally quiet night shift. Inspired by 90's pulp media like Outer Limits, Twilight Zone, Twin Peaks, and X-Files.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flight Management Sim: </strong>Direct incoming and outgoing flights at Ganlley Airport using radar, runways, and your own best judgment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Controls: </strong>Move objects and interact with the world using physics inspired by titles like Garry\u2019s Mod.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Evening Dreary:</strong> Let narrative events unfold while you engage with your work. See how your actions unfold the evening\u2019s mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
